hpc:Project a owl:Class .
hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:relaxjobdispatchorder a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:allocreuseduration a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:share a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Usergroup a owl:Class .

hpc:Project rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .
hpc:Job rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .
hpc:Relaxjobdispatchorder rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
                            rdfs:range hpc:Relaxjobdispatchordervalue .
hpc:Allocreuseduration rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
                            rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:Share rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
                      rdfs:range (hpc:User | hpc:Usergroup) .
hpc:Usergroup rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class .

hpc:RelaxJobDispatchOrderValue rdf:type owl:Datatype .
hpc:Relaxjobdispatchordervalue rdfs:subClassOf xsd:string .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Project, Job, RelaxJobDispatchOrder, AllocReuseDuration, Share, and UserGroup. It also defines object properties for RelaxJobDispatchOrder, Share, and datatype properties for AllocReuseDuration and RelaxJobDispatchOrderValue. The domain and range constraints are also specified for each property.
